  "rationale": "The plant automata model the robot's motion and perception capabilities, separating motion commands from sensor outcomes. The specification automata bind sensor outcomes to safe, progress-oriented actions, enforce conservative obstacle recovery, and prevent unsafe or oscillatory behaviors. Recovery actions are brief and escalate only if repeated blockages occur. The design ensures the robot explores efficiently, avoids collisions, and returns to forward exploration as soon as possible after recovery.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for motion and perception to allow modular specification.",
    "Specification automata bind perception outcomes to safe, progress-oriented actions, enforce conservative recovery, and escalate to full_rotate only after repeated failures."
